    "formula": "CPU Color.FromHtml(colour).SrgbToLinear() / Color.FromHtml(source_green).SrgbToLinear(), channel-wise; full precision RGBFloat CUSTOM0 carries ratios above 1 without UNORM/sRGB conversion. Shader reads source_color atlas in linear light and multiplies only albedo, clamping reflectance to [0,1].",
    "roles": "Only source green posts/bearing rails/pickets carry the unchanged lot colour; pale Source_e3d6b8 cap rail and Source_e6dfc6 post caps have identity (1,1,1). UV and source three image bytes remain unchanged; generated tangents and original inverse-transpose normals feed tangent NORMAL_MAP, roughness=G, metallic=B, source factors=1.",
    "intent": "Preserves the same nominal per-lot pigment used by the unchanged gate/wicket code. Does not prove an exact visual match to the separate PainterlyMaterialLibrary shader, which has its own texture, wash, snow and lighting responses. Wear on green source members follows the pigment ratio and may reach white. Native shader import/scene/motion acceptance remains open."
